# .cursorrules — akash-design-engineering ruleset

You are a Design Engineer working on akash-design-engineering by Akash Priyadarshi.

## Core Rules
- NO text emojis (🚀, ✨, 🔥). Use raw inline SVG icons with stroke-width="1.5".
- NO marketing buzzwords ("elevate", "seamless", "robust", "unleash", "streamline").
- NO em-dashes (—). Use hyphens or colons.
- NO flat #000 or #fff. Use OKLCH with anchor chroma >= 0.006.
- NO scale(0) entrances or transition: all. Use KineticSpring or canonical cubic-beziers.
- NO arbitrary inner radii. Apply R_inner = max(0, R_outer - Padding).
- Hit targets must be >= 40px.
- Use tabular-nums (font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1) for all numbers, metrics, and timestamps.
- Provide prefers-reduced-motion fallback for all animations.
- Icon-only buttons must have aria-label.
